+    Native ``json_schema`` providers return ``{"raw", "parsed", "parsing_error"}``;
+    we log the raw message's token usage and turn a schema violation into
+    :class:`LLMBadResponseError` so the batch-level isolation (and the JSON
+    retry) keep working exactly as they do for the prompt-driven path.
